{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts","id":1025776,"title":"Kindred and Ghosts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-03T01:34:20-08:00","id":1025776,"title":"Kindred and Ghosts","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> can anyone provide me any suggestion about inreraction between vamp and ghost, and about ghost with human world in general?<br /> <br /> 1) Can they comunicate without medium merit? <br /> 2)How they can interact with material world? <br /> 3)How a vampire can harm a ghost and vice versa? <br /> 4)Do the vampire disciplines (nightmare, dominate, majesty) have effect on ghost? <br /> 5) does auspex allow the vamp to be aware of a ghost spying her? If yes, is impossible to see the ghost anyway, isn't it? <br /> <br /> Any other lore element would be appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T02:30:01-08:00","id":1025791,"title":"","content":"If memory serves, in first edition the Nosferatu had some connections with ghosts, and I know some of the blood sorcery stuff in both editions deal with ghosts. Otherwise, it's mostly up to the Storyteller. Most storytellers I've played with have vampires interact with ghosts in the same way a normal mortal interacts with ghosts. I remember one Storyteller having an Invictus elder with ghosts at his command because he had their anchors, but that was supposed to be rare among Kindred.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T02:39:53-08:00","id":1025794,"title":"","content":"I don't remember anything from 2E material about vampire-ghost interaction. They probably need blood sorcery, a Coil, or some Devotion to even start seeing ghosts. Punching them or hitting them with Disciplines will come after that.<br /> <br /> I only remember the Unnatural Affinity Merit allowing vampires to feed on ghosts as if they were Kindred for the purposes of overcoming feeding restrictions.<br /> <br /> Ghosts interact with the physical world just like other ephemeral entities (mostly spirits) do. They hang around their Anchors to prevent Essence Bleed, they use Manifestations to interact with people, and use Numina and Influences to puruse whatever agenda it is that keeps them going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T06:05:55-08:00","id":1025880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marcus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts#post1025776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Can they comunicate without medium merit?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Ghosts can start the conversation, potentially. There's some abilities that allow for it as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2)How they can interact with material world? </div> </div> </div>They generally Manifest, or use Numina to affect the material world.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3)How a vampire can harm a ghost and vice versa? </div> </div> </div>It's bane, magic. A ghost could potentially set things on fire.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 4)Do the vampire disciplines (nightmare, dominate, majesty) have effect on ghost? </div> </div> </div>Yes. Probably most notable is <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Essentiaphagia\" target=\"_blank\">Essentiaphagia</a>, which allows for the diablerie of ghosts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 5) does auspex allow the vamp to be aware of a ghost spying her? If yes, is impossible to see the ghost anyway, isn't it? </div> </div> </div>I'd say the first dot would only alert you if there was a threatening ghost in the room, or if you specifically asked a question related to the ghost, such as 'am I being watched?' I think you'd need a Devotion to get really involved with ghosts, but it would fit within Auspex just fine.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Any other lore element would be appreciated <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div>As mentioned above, the Nosferatu have a connection, as well as the Dragolescu bloodline of the Ordo Dracul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T06:11:34-08:00","id":1025881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1025880#post1025880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's bane, magic. A ghost could potentially set things on fire.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yes. Probably most notable is <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Essentiaphagia\" target=\"_blank\">Essentiaphagia</a>, which allows for the diablerie of ghosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gah, forgot about banes (and bans). And yeah, there are 1E-source materials that allow interaction with ghosts. Too bad there aren't official 2E updates of them. Still, check out the homebrew thread just in case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T06:20:04-08:00","id":1025884,"title":"","content":"Thank you all.<br /> So, trough auspex I know a ghost is watching me, can I use Dominate or Majesty even if it isn't manifested or I can use them just when it manifest itself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T06:39:14-08:00","id":1025897,"title":"","content":"Majesty I'd say yes. Dominate would require the ghost to be able to see the vampire's eyes, which might take some finesse if the vampire can't tell exactly where the ghost is (though I would allow an exceptional success on any roll to detect one's presence to provide that, if the power used doesn't already).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T06:43:08-08:00","id":1025901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marcus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1025884#post1025884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you all.<br /> So, trough auspex I know a ghost is watching me, can I use Dominate or Majesty even if it isn't manifested or I can use them just when it manifest itself?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dominate requires eye contact, so either the ghost will have to make itself visible (usually through a Manifestation), or the vampire has to do something to see ghosts.<br /> <br /> Majesty, on the other hand, makes the vampire himself more likeable, so it might work on ghosts who observe the vampire in close vicinity. Same for Nightmare, although you didn't ask for this one.<br /> <br /> Of course, the least ambiguous method would be to have the ghost Manifest, or the vampire use some custom-made Devotion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T09:16:56-08:00","id":1025975,"title":"","content":"Kindred can employ any of the ways to Interact with Ephemerals available to mortals in Chronicles of Darkness, (except I presume Abjuration since that requires an Integrity Score), with the additional benefit of being able to utilize Disciplines - Auspex would let you detect a non-manifest ghost and Majesty or Dominate will work mostly unchanged if the ghost can see the Kindred. Nightmare should work mostly alright as well, as would Obfuscate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T09:25:45-08:00","id":1025983,"title":"","content":"Many thanks. <br /> Can you give me a little list of evocative banes and ban for ghosts/Spirits?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T10:15:58-08:00","id":1026009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1025901#post1025901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dominate requires eye contact, so either the ghost will have to make itself visible (usually through a Manifestation), or the vampire has to do something to see ghosts.</div> </div> </div> </div>It only requires the ghost to see the vampire's eyes, not the other way round.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T11:59:37-08:00","id":1026094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1026009#post1026009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It only requires the ghost to see the vampire's eyes, not the other way round.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I'd be pretty forgiving about that. The eye contact is there to capture that moment where the monster catches her victim's gaze and mesmerizes him, because it makes for a cool visual. It's not meant to present a significant obstacle to the player getting to use what's on their sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T16:05:08-08:00","id":1026197,"title":"","content":"Khaibit can layeth the smack down on Ghosts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T16:48:53-08:00","id":1026219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1026009#post1026009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It only requires the ghost to see the vampire's eyes, not the other way round.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1025776-kindred-and-ghosts?p=1026094#post1026094\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I'd be pretty forgiving about that. The eye contact is there to capture that moment where the monster catches her victim's gaze and mesmerizes him, because it makes for a cool visual. It's not meant to present a significant obstacle to the player getting to use what's on their sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh. Well, this makes things more interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T17:29:04-08:00","id":1026239,"title":"","content":"I think the translation guide has some info here. From my search on it in the past that seems like the best method. I could see a high humanity vampire being able to make use of the mortal interaction rules for ephemeral beings if you don't like the material in the translation guide. Humanity in my opinion could possibly act as integrity for those parts that require it but even without a &quot;humanity = integrity&quot; type agreement there are still aspects of the mortal interaction rules that'd be of use to a vampire in my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T04:24:57-08:00","id":1027533,"title":"","content":"Thanks to all you, now I have a clearer view about the ephemeral entites.<br /> But, reading the Black Nathanien Angel stat (CoD p. 254) I saw the huge values in the attributes: Power (13), Finesse (11), Resistance (12).<br /> I still don't have clear the transition between those stats and the attributes like strenght, dext, stamina.<br /> If it were to materialize and, interact with material being, which stats should have him? How many dot should I distribuite to each attributes? I read in the table that the attributes limit is 36-45. Does it means 36-45 should be divided between ALL the attributes (intelligence, wits, strenght, presence and so on), right? The limit for each attributes should be 15 or can be bypassed?<br /> <br /> A question about an hipotetical combat while he is materialized: Since he hasn't skills how should be created the attack pool? Strength+Dexterity? Strength + rank?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T08:24:20-08:00","id":1027678,"title":"","content":"Ephemeral entities still use their three attribute spread even when materialized. So it's still Power, Finesse, Resistance. The attribute spread is for those three.<br /> <br /> The basic attack pool for them is Power + Finesse. And yes that means that Black Nathaniel would have a base 23 to attack. High Rank entities are terrifying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T08:32:26-08:00","id":1027687,"title":"","content":"So, what &quot;Attribute Dots&quot; stands for in the Rank table?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T08:40:07-08:00","id":1027695,"title":"","content":"Attribute dots is how many points you should distribute between Power, Finesse, and Resistance for a entity of that Rank. Up to the max amount according to the Trait Limit column per trait. <br /> <br /> So a Rank 5 Entity has between 36-45 dots spread between Power, Finesse, and Resistance with any one of the three not being higher than 15.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T08:45:13-08:00","id":1027697,"title":"","content":"Ok, now I understand. Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}